{"id":"0c361d04d5a15f9e","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Basis Neighborhood","display":"df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood — ZFC Top2 Basis Neighborhood","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood — ZFC Top2 Basis Neighborhood","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top-base]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-basis-neighborhood — ZFC Top2 Basis Neighborhood"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-base\">58-df-zfc-top-base</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,x,X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(B,x,X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (topological-base predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2BasisNeighborhood}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2BasisNeighborhood}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}basis\\text{-}neighborhood} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2BasisNeighborhood}_S(B,x,X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land B\\in\\mathcal B\\land x\\in B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}basis\\text{-}neighborhood} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2BasisNeighborhood}_S(B,x,X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land B\\in\\mathcal B\\land x\\in B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This selects precisely the basic open sets from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> that contain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>; no separate neighborhood-filter predicate is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-base","status":"resolved","id":"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top-base]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,x,X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2BasisNeighborhood}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}basis\\text{-}neighborhood} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2BasisNeighborhood}_S(B,x,X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land B\\in\\mathcal B\\land x\\in B","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B